@startuml
title Pati — Modüler Monolit Servis Sınırları
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
package "Public API" {
 [REST Controllers / OpenAPI] as REST
 [Auth / RBAC / Validation] as AUTH
}
package "Core Modules" {
 [Identity] as ID
 [Pet / Health] as PET
 [Provider] as PROV
 [Catalog] as CAT
 [Availability] as AV
 [Booking] as BOOK
 [Payment / Ledger] as PAY
 [Trust / Dispute] as TRUST
 [Consent / CRM] as CRM
}
package "Separate Deployments" {
 [Notification Worker] as NOTIF
 [Import Worker] as IMP
 [AI / 3D Gateway] as AI
}
package "Platform" {
 [Outbox] as OUT
 [NATS Events] as BUS
 [Temporal Workflows] as WF
 [Audit] as AUDIT
}
REST --> AUTH
REST --> ID
REST --> PET
REST --> PROV
REST --> CAT
REST --> AV
REST --> BOOK
REST --> PAY
REST --> TRUST
REST --> CRM
BOOK --> AV : application port
BOOK --> PAY : application port
BOOK --> WF : timeout/saga
PROV --> CAT : verified provider port
CRM --> NOTIF : event only
PET --> AI : async job port
BOOK --> OUT
PAY --> OUT
TRUST --> OUT
OUT --> BUS
BUS --> NOTIF
BUS --> IMP
BUS --> AI
ID --> AUDIT
PAY --> AUDIT
TRUST --> AUDIT
note bottom
Modüller başka modülün repository veya tablosuna yazamaz.
Tek transaction yalnız modül verisi + outbox içerir.
Harici servis çağrısı açık DB transaction içinde yapılmaz.
end note
@enduml
